    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Auxiliary Cadre",
    "summary": "Your Kroot and Vespid Stingwings units have Harnessed Alien Instincts, which lets such a unit, during your Shooting phase, choose one enemy unit it can see within 12\", and that enemy becomes prey-marked; a prey-marked unit's detection range is increased by 3\". Your GHOSTKEEL BATTLESUIT and STEALTH BATTLESUITS units have Localised Stealth Projectors (Aura): if a Kroot or Vespid Stingwings unit of yours within 6\" of such a unit has shot, its shooting does not stop it counting as hidden. This Detachment carries the AUXILIARIES tag, so it cannot be combined with another AUXILIARIES Detachment. The card does not say how long a unit stays prey-marked.",
